Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:22.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,《星际迷航：新世界》前情提要\N{\rENG}Previously on Star Trek: Strange New Worlds...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:24.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是科尔比博士\N{\rENG}This is Dr. Korby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.82,0:00:27.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,一开始她只是学生 但事情很快发生了变化\N{\rENG}At first she was a fellow, but she quickly became more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.29,0:00:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,她和我之前一块在瓦迪亚九星管理考古发掘点\N{\rENG}She was running the excavation site on Vadia Nine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.06,0:00:31.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,瓦肯人有一种古代技艺\N{\rENG}Vulcans have an ancient technique
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.66,0:00:32.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,能通过冥想来调节疼痛\N{\rENG}of regulating pain through meditation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.07,0:00:37.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,当我们心灵融合的时候\N{\rENG}When we joined minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我吸纳了您的痛苦\N{\rENG}I absorbed your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.23,0:00:39.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看到了什么\N{\rENG}I saw something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:41.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,它感觉既像是您的一部分 又不是\N{\rENG}It felt both a part of you and not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:41.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,是戈恩吗\N{\rENG}Was it Gorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:45.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为这种愿意尝试新事物的态度非常适合你\N{\rENG}This openness to new life experiences suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:46.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 这是谁\N{\rENG}Okay. Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.81,0:00:48.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我弟弟\N{\rENG}My little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.10,0:00:49.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际舰队公关部\N{\rENG}Starfleet's Public Relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.21,0:00:50.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,有意向让我拍一部\N{\rENG}They may commission
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:52.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际舰队的纪录片电影\N{\rENG}a feature-length documentary of Starfleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.39,0:01:02.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,初级医疗官日志\N{\rENG}Junior medical officer's log,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.02,0:01:04.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,星历2184.4\N{\rENG}stardate 2184.4.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.58,0:01:07.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,联邦星舰进取号报告\N{\rENG}Reporting from the USS Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.73,0:01:09.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,进取号这个词\N{\rENG}Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.40,0:01:11.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么说都说不厌\N{\rENG}I will never get tired of saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:15.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,能在这里任职六个月简直太棒了\N{\rENG}The last six months stationed here have been awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我也像往常一样\N{\rENG}Today started out like any other day here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.61,0:01:19.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,在医务室工作着\N{\rENG}me working in sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.34,0:01:22.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我知道过完今天\N{\rENG}But after today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.21,0:01:25.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的生活将被彻底改变\N{\rENG}I know my life is never gonna be the same again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:28.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,噢 真激动 可不是吗\N{\rENG}Oh. Exciting, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.65,0:01:31.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 如果你对这个课题感兴趣\N{\rENG}Yeah, if you're into that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.39,0:01:36.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔护士和科尔比博士就要创下历史了\N{\rENG}Nurse Chapel and Dr. Korby are about to make history.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.19,0:01:39.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 这可能会改变我们对生死的认知\N{\rENG}Well, this could change the way we view mortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.20,0:01:40.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,以及科尔比对分子存储器和\N{\rENG}And Korby's work on molecular memory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.03,0:01:42.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,转移实体的研究\N{\rENG}and corporeal transference.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.60,0:01:44.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至古人痴迷的那些\N{\rENG}The idea that ancient man's fascination
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:46.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,所谓复活与轮回论\N{\rENG}with resurrection and reincarnation
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:48.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,居然其实是被人遗忘的古老科技吗 你看这\N{\rENG}could all be based on forgotten technology? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:50.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你对这个课题感兴趣\N{\rENG}If you're into that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.80,0:01:53.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是看过他的一些论文\N{\rENG}I may have read some of his papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.90,0:01:56.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我需要考虑把你转配到考古医学部吗\N{\rENG}Should I expect a transfer request from you to archaeological medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:57.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,千万别\N{\rENG}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.80,0:02:00.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 去古老的星球上挖土\N{\rENG}I mean, as fun as it sounds to dig up old worlds
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,寻找尘封的古代医疗技术是有意思\N{\rENG}and find lost medical science,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.50,0:02:03.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我更喜欢现在的岗位\N{\rENG}I like where I'm at.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:05.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么 如果你也想创造历史\N{\rENG}Well, you can make your own mark on history
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.62,0:02:08.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以赶紧趁着巴特尔舰长还没来\N{\rENG}by charging the dermal wands at all the biobed stations
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:11.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,先去给生物床里所有的真皮再生器充能\N{\rENG}before Captain Batel gets here for her treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:12.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到长官 这就去\N{\rENG}Gotcha, sir. On it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定进取号的偏导阵列\N{\rENG}You're sure the Enterprise's deflector array
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会压掉那片磁场异象吗\N{\rENG}won't overpower the magnetic anomaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:26.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我到底需要向你保证多少次不会出事的\N{\rENG}How many times do I have to promise you it's all gonna be fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:27.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\rENG}I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.92,0:02:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有和派克说过 这个地方对当地人\N{\rENG}You, uh, you let Pike know how-how sacred this place was
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.08,0:02:31.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,来说是非常神圣的\N{\rENG}to the people here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:32.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真以为星际舰队\N{\rENG}Do you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.78,0:02:34.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,会过去随意搞事 肆意挥舞相位枪\N{\rENG}that Starfleet is just gonna waltz on in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:37.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,到头来夷平一个文化遗址吗\N{\rENG}phasers blasting, and obliterate a heritage site?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.30,0:02:38.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 不觉得\N{\rENG}Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.96,0:02:40.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这也不能怪我吧 我是说\N{\rENG}But-but-but can you blame me? I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.20,0:02:43.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些时候习惯于发号施令的人\N{\rENG}sometimes people that-that are used to giving orders struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:45.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,轮到他们接受命令时就会犯难\N{\rENG}when-when receiving them, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.22,0:02:46.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 你可说到点子上了\N{\rENG}God, you're so right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都想去给派克舰长来一针\N{\rENG}I'm just gonna go and hypospray Captain Pike
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样他就不会把差事都往咱们身上扔了\N{\rENG}so he doesn't give us, like, any trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.78,0:02:53.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,多少剂量的塔拉嗪才不致死来着\N{\rENG}How much Tarazine is sublethal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.20,0:02:55.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我老是记错这些数字\N{\rENG}Just always get the numbers all mixed-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:56.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,笑我很好玩吧\N{\rENG}You having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不给他一枪爆头算了\N{\rENG}Maybe just a blow to the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:03:00.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,指令功能是左半脑负责 对吧\N{\rENG}Command function's left lobe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:01.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯哼 嗯哼\N{\rENG}Mm-hmm, mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.81,0:03:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 听着 我可能是有点偏执了\N{\rENG}Okay, look, maybe I'm being a little paranoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.65,0:03:05.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,你吗 亲爱的\N{\rENG}Oh, you, my dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.68,0:03:07.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,才没有\N{\rENG}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.48,0:03:10.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道为了说服派克舰长帮忙\N{\rENG}I know how much work you've, you've put in,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:12.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,你做出了多大的努力\N{\rENG}lobbying Captain Pike to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:14.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,要是没有星舰\N{\rENG}There's just no getting below
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.92,0:03:16.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可没法下到星球表面\N{\rENG}the planet's surface without a starship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:18.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的感激难以言表\N{\rENG}And I am more than grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.28,0:03:21.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,-我只是经常在开工之前 -你总是在开工之前\N{\rENG}-It's just that I always get nervous... -You always get nervous
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.23,0:03:22.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,感到紧张\N{\rENG}...before a dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.53,0:03:25.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\rENG}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,一会见 罗杰\N{\rENG}I'll see you soon, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:33.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 会见的\N{\rENG}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.70,0:03:34.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,动作快点\N{\rENG}Hurry down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:35.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让我等太久\N{\rENG}Don't make me wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.14,0:03:42.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔\N{\rENG}Chapel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.62,0:03:44.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 问一句\N{\rENG}Uh, quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克现在怎么样\N{\rENG}How's Spock doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:49.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该还好吧\N{\rENG}Fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.46,0:03:51.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,今天我没见着他\N{\rENG}I haven't seen him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:54.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,他有说什么关于罗杰的事吗\N{\rENG}Has he, uh, said anything about Roger being here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看 我知道你们俩\N{\rENG}I mean, I know you guys have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.37,0:04:01.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,最近几个月\N{\rENG}spending more time, getting closer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,-走的还挺近的 -噢不\N{\rENG}-these last months. -Oh. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你别跟其他女人一样当醋坛子\N{\rENG}No, please don't be one of those women.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.34,0:04:05.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是为什么我不谈恋爱\N{\rENG}This is why I don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:07.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我吗 不是不是\N{\rENG}Oh, me? No. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.41,0:04:09.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,才不是\N{\rENG}Heck no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.35,0:04:10.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不介意\N{\rENG}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.12,0:04:12.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克和我明确地谈过\N{\rENG}Spock and I made it very clear with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:15.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要互贴标签 不要把对方期望得太高\N{\rENG}No labels, no complicated expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要过得开心就好\N{\rENG}Just fun times.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.40,0:04:19.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托 别把事情又弄麻烦了\N{\rENG}Please don't make it weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:22.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样你真的能接受吗\N{\rENG}Uh, y-you're good with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.78,0:04:26.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 如果你真的担心\N{\rENG}Look, if you're really worried about 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:28.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克会不会去骚扰科尔比 你可以直接问他\N{\rENG}Spock behaving around Korby, then just ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.16,0:04:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,毕竟我们都是成年人了\N{\rENG}We're all adults here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.28,0:04:31.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,对\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.23,0:04:32.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,实在不可思议 史波克的才智加上\N{\rENG}It's amazing. With Spock's brain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:43.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加的研究 和查普尔精湛的基因技术\N{\rENG}M'Benga's research, and Chapel's genetic expertise,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,说实话 这真是\N{\rENG}frankly, it's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.21,0:04:45.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,别说这是奇迹\N{\rENG}Don't say "miracle."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.73,0:04:46.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,尖端科学的硕果\N{\rENG}Top-notch science.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.98,0:04:50.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的病人怎么样啦\N{\rENG}How's my favorite patient doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:52.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\rENG}Great, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:53.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 约瑟夫\N{\rENG}Thank you, Joseph.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了你所做的一切\N{\rENG}What you've done here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.32,0:04:57.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我欠你个大人情\N{\rENG}I owe it to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:01.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,真皮再生器怎么样了\N{\rENG}How are the dermal wands looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.83,0:05:02.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切就绪 长官\N{\rENG}All accounted for, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:04.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有生物床都充好能了\N{\rENG}Every biobed station fully charged.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,远程同步器呢\N{\rENG}And the remote synthesizers?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:08.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会问 所以我把它们也重新充能了\N{\rENG}I thought you would ask, so I recharged them, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.60,0:05:10.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好 那你就不会迟到了\N{\rENG}Good. So you won't be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.74,0:05:12.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 迟到什么\N{\rENG}Uh, late for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.11,0:05:13.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,任务简报\N{\rENG}The mission brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:16.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,外勤队成员都要去开会\N{\rENG}The landing party's meeting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:17.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么外勤队\N{\rENG}The landing party?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.75,0:05:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,瓦迪亚九星的外勤队吗\N{\rENG}On Vadia Nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:23.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是已经请求过六次加入外勤队了吗\N{\rENG}You've requested away team assignment six times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:26.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你值得的\N{\rENG}You've earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:29.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让我在科尔比博士面前丢脸就行\N{\rENG}Just don't embarrass me with Dr. Korby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:37.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是太激动了\N{\rENG}I'm sorry. I'm just so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.31,0:05:38.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\rENG}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不然他们可不等你了\N{\rENG}They'll start without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:46.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是第一个正式\N{\rENG}My first official research mission
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.94,0:05:48.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,交给我的外星研究任务\N{\rENG}on an alien planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:49.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,这可是自我进入星际舰队学院以来\N{\rENG}I've been dreaming of this since I was first accepted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.88,0:05:51.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,就梦寐以求的事情\N{\rENG}to Starfleet Academy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:53.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,而现在正是我大展拳脚的时候了\N{\rENG}And now it's my time to shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.79,0:06:05.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克少校\N{\rENG}Lieutenant Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.87,0:06:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么每次我们需要谈谈的时候你总是这么安静\N{\rENG}Why are we always so quiet when we need to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:17.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么需要谈的吗\N{\rENG}Is there something to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.74,0:06:20.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我呢\N{\rENG}I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.01,0:06:23.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴看到你和努尼恩辛格上尉\N{\rENG}glad to see you and Lieutenant Noonien-Singh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.61,0:06:25.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,在一起待的时间更久了\N{\rENG}spending more time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是一位优秀的舞蹈老师\N{\rENG}She is an excellent dance instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,这也很好啊\N{\rENG}That, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:38.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.93,0:06:41.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰对发掘工作有些紧张\N{\rENG}Roger's... feeling nervous about the dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.29,0:06:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后 呃\N{\rENG}And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.60,0:06:45.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是 我知道你们俩现在差不多 交上朋友了\N{\rENG}you know, I know you guys are, like, friends now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.37,0:06:46.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,相对来说没错\N{\rENG}A relative term.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:51.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想确保事情进展顺利 不要干扰到工作\N{\rENG}I just want to be s-sure that things are gonna go smoothly down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:53.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不信任我\N{\rENG}You do not trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:54.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用担心 克莉丝汀\N{\rENG}Not to worry, Christine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.31,0:06:57.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我制定了必要的保障措施\N{\rENG}I have instituted certain safeguards
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,来保证一切工作顺利进行\N{\rENG}to ensure it will all go smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:02.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思 什么措施\N{\rENG}What do you, what do you mean, "safeguards"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.29,0:07:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,啊 太好了 同伴们\N{\rENG}Ah, great! Crewmates!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:13.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不用一个人参加简报会啦\N{\rENG}I don't have to go into the briefing alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:18.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是不是打扰你们说话了\N{\rENG}I interrupted something, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛克戎人已经不止一次\N{\rENG}The M'Kroon have declined Federation membership 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.82,0:07:24.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,拒绝加入联邦了\N{\rENG} on multiple occasions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:26.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以他们只允许派出一个小型外勤队\N{\rENG}which is why they're only allowing a small landing party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:27.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 查普尔 你要先亲自上阵\N{\rENG}All right, Chapel, you'll be boots on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:30.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,一旦信号增强器就位 就通知我们出发\N{\rENG}Give us the go-ahead once the signal amplifiers are in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.65,0:07:33.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,科学小组的人已经调整好偏导阵列了吗\N{\rENG}Has the science team finished adjusting the deflector arrays?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rENG}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.18,0:07:36.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,之后我会留驻在进取号上\N{\rENG}And I will be monitoring the adjustments in real time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.42,0:07:38.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,实时监测这些调整的情况\N{\rENG}here aboard the Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:40.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,留在舰上观测数据\N{\rENG}Monitoring from the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,就是你的保障措施\N{\rENG}as a safeguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.12,0:07:44.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不打算下到星球表面上\N{\rENG}You're not coming down to the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.70,0:07:48.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔 这是你的任务 \N{\rENG}Chapel, this is your mission. 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:51.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有其他\N{\rENG}Any last...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.17,0:07:53.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,想法或是想说的吗\N{\rENG}thoughts or words?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能再讲一次吗\N{\rENG}Could you do that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:57.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,奥特加斯先生\N{\rENG}Mr. Ortegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 有子空间的静电干扰 我得调整一下\N{\rENG}Sorry. I just needed to adjust for subspace static.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:03.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,-有点妨碍到我的 -奥特加斯先生\N{\rENG}-It interferes with my... -Mr. Ortegas,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.20,0:08:05.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾丽卡答应过你不会添麻烦的\N{\rENG}Erica promised you wouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.82,0:08:08.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你保持安静 你会拍到更好的画面\N{\rENG}You'll get better footage if you just keep it quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:10.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\rENG}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.32,0:08:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,年轻人\N{\rENG}Young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.92,0:08:15.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你在工程部有什么想了解的\N{\rENG}if there is anything you want to see in Engineering,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么都行\N{\rENG}anything at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.33,0:08:19.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我非常乐意能为你\N{\rENG}I am more than comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:20.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,上一上镜\N{\rENG}around a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:22.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道的 佩利亚 咱们别鼓励这种\N{\rENG}You know what, Pelia, let's not encourage...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘布尔少尉\N{\rENG}Ensign Gamble,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:28.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,能请你给我们读读任务简报的第一段吗\N{\rENG}would you kindly read the first paragraph of our mission brief?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:37.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,「为了纪念联邦成立一百周年\N{\rENG}"To commemorate the Federation's centennial,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:39.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,纪录片制作人温贝多·奥特加斯\N{\rENG}"documentarian Humberto Ortegas
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.64,0:08:41.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,已经获得了安全许可\N{\rENG}"has been given security clearance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:44.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,以便记录进取号最近执行的任务」\N{\rENG}to record Enterprise's current roster of missions."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:47.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 既然如此 我们就是绑在一根绳上的蚂蚱了\N{\rENG}Okay, according to that, we're stuck with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:49.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,但希望你能尽量别让相机那么碍事\N{\rENG}But maybe just try to keep the cameras out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:54.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起来发掘过去吧\N{\rENG}Let's go dig up the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔\N{\rENG}N'Jal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:20.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢你允许我们记录下这个\N{\rENG}Thank you for allowing us to document this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,历史性的时刻\N{\rENG}historic occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:23.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸会幸会 这是我的荣幸\N{\rENG}It is such an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:29.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说玛克戎人的声域十分奇特\N{\rENG}I hear the M'Kroon have a unique vocal range.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:32.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\rENG}Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:33.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,让我给你瞧瞧\N{\rENG}Let me show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:34.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\rENG}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.67,0:09:35.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\rENG}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:37.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\rENG}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是那个磁场异象吗\N{\rENG}Our magnetic anomaly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:41.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得对 这个地方\N{\rENG}You were right about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.84,0:09:44.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,确实存在某种先进的技术\N{\rENG}There is indeed some form of advanced technology
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:46.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,就藏在我们脚下\N{\rENG}hiding beneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:53.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\rENG}Let's set up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:54.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看它是什么\N{\rENG}see what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:04.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.57,0:10:07.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这东西让你忙了好久吧\N{\rENG}They keep you busy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:10.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们平时一般没机会摆弄玩具\N{\rENG}We don't all get to play with toys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.32,0:10:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,来这里\N{\rENG}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.96,0:10:14.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给你看个东西\N{\rENG}Let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:21.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个设备操作起来很简单\N{\rENG}So, it's intuitive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.58,0:10:24.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,人工智能镜头会追踪说话过程中动作和语调的变化\N{\rENG}A.I. lenses track movement and inflections in speech
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:26.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,记录下其中隐含的强烈情绪\N{\rENG}that indicate strong emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:29.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,它能记录下言外之意的暗示吗\N{\rENG}Uh, it clocks nonverbal cues?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,它总是会寻找各种隐台词 激烈的情绪\N{\rENG}It's always looking for the subtext, the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许正是因此 它聚焦在我们身上了\N{\rENG}Could be why it's focused on us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.74,0:10:41.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定了 乌乎拉\N{\rENG}Done here. Uhura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们那边进展怎样\N{\rENG}How's it going over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.30,0:10:52.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,完成啦\N{\rENG}Finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.58,0:10:57.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔呼叫舰桥 传输塔已部署\N{\rENG}Chapel to the bridge. The pylons are set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:10:59.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,随时待命\N{\rENG}Ready when you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.42,0:11:01.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到 准备接收偏导波束\N{\rENG}Copy. Stand by for deflector beams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.58,0:11:23.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 我们需要规模更大的外勤队\N{\rENG}Captain, we're gonna need a bigger landing party.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会下来\N{\rENG}I knew you'd have to come down
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.97,0:13:27.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,亲自看看这些的\N{\rENG}and see this all for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:29.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你说啥来着 你欠我一顿酒\N{\rENG}What'd I tell you? You owe me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.14,0:13:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛克戎人否决了我们增员的请求\N{\rENG}The M'Kroons vetoed our request to send more personnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.01,0:13:38.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以只有史波克和我来了\N{\rENG}so Spock and I are the only ones coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.04,0:13:39.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白了\N{\rENG}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.65,0:13:43.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找到了一个访问面板\N{\rENG}Uh, we found an access panel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:45.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,上面有不明语言的字符\N{\rENG}with symbols in an unknown language.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.62,0:13:47.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些字符是操作界面吗\N{\rENG}These symbols are the interface?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:51.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许吧 或者是使用说明\N{\rENG}Maybe. Or instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:52.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,又或者是一种警告\N{\rENG}Or a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.43,0:13:53.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来和玛克戎字母\N{\rENG}They have a remarkable similarity
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.93,0:13:55.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,有相当高的相似性\N{\rENG}to the M'Kroonian alphabet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以 五年前\N{\rENG}So, five years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.33,0:13:58.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在几百万光年之外的地方\N{\rENG}hundreds of light-years from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:00.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,发现了这个\N{\rENG}I discovered this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得这个标记是皇室的象征\N{\rENG}I believe it is a royal insignia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:04.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以这地方可能是\N{\rENG}So this place could be
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.67,0:14:08.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,某种神庙或者宫殿\N{\rENG}some sort of temple or palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.28,0:14:10.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只知道 这只戒指是在北极星十二号找到的\N{\rENG}All I know is, I found this ring on Polaris 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.82,0:14:13.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是普莱托利安也上有相似的几组符号\N{\rENG}But there are similar symbol sets on Praetorian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.25,0:14:14.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们那里找到了几块石板\N{\rENG}Where we found tablets...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯汀发现上面的文字和\N{\rENG}That Christine matched with ancient texts here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.89,0:14:17.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,瓦迪亚九星的古文相符\N{\rENG}on Vadia Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们认为玛克戎人是\N{\rENG}We think the M'Kroon are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.96,0:14:22.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,某个先进文明的直属后裔\N{\rENG}the direct descendants of an advanced civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.79,0:14:25.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,而该文明能够在多个星系间旅行\N{\rENG}that could travel across multiple galaxies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,远古宇航员吗\N{\rENG}Ancient astronauts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.56,0:14:28.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,不得而知\N{\rENG}We don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是他们自称已经获得了永生\N{\rENG}but they claim to have achieved immortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.78,0:14:33.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,老生常谈的谬论\N{\rENG}A common myth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,众多文明都共有的一类幻想\N{\rENG}A fantasy many cultures share.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:38.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们的研究显示 这个文明\N{\rENG}But in this case our research suggests that 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.96,0:14:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,实现永生的秘密\N{\rENG}their secret to immortality...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.41,0:14:43.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,有可能涉及到在分子层面上\N{\rENG}Had something to do with creating quantum instability
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:44.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,制造量子不稳定现象\N{\rENG}at a molecular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:47.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\rENG}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吧\N{\rENG}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,总之 我交叉对比了这些字符\N{\rENG}Okay, so I cross-referenced the symbols
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.72,0:14:53.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,以普莱托利安语和玛克戎古文为参考\N{\rENG}with Praetorian and ancient M'Kroonian.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.99,0:14:58.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,「救赎之道 就在自愿血祭之中」\N{\rENG}"The path to absolution, only with blood given freely."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:15:00.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,自愿血祭\N{\rENG}Blood given freely?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,一种祭祀礼仪 给神明的献礼\N{\rENG}A ritual sacrifice. An offering to the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.73,0:15:05.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,血祭魔法\N{\rENG}Blood magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,在玛克戎上 我们的祖先会自我献祭\N{\rENG}On M'Kroon, our ancestors would sacrifice
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.66,0:15:11.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,以来到时间众神的面前\N{\rENG}to stand before the deities of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.45,0:15:18.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,喔 等等\N{\rENG}Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.28,0:15:20.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\rENG}Just take a moment
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:22.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,先别急着干这么戏剧化的事情\N{\rENG}before we choose the dramatic option.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,别\N{\rENG}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,认真的吗\N{\rENG}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:02.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,它奏效了\N{\rENG}It worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.46,0:16:08.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的血里没有检测到外来成分\N{\rENG}Nothing foreign detected in your bloodstream.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,疼吗 有没有什么症状\N{\rENG}Any pain, symptoms of any kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:12.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事 少尉\N{\rENG}I'll live, Ensign.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.17,0:16:15.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 查普尔 这是你的主场了\N{\rENG}Well, Chapel, this is your party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜你会想和我一起走\N{\rENG}I'm guessing you want to come with me on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:39.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心脚下 别碰任何东西\N{\rENG}Watch your footing and try not to touch anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:42.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 我来这里就是为了碰东西的 中尉\N{\rENG}Sadly, that would defeat my entire purpose here, Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.92,0:16:45.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 你知道我什么意思的\N{\rENG}Well, you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.94,0:16:52.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,和星舰的联系断了\N{\rENG}Comms on the ship are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.78,0:16:55.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,也就是我们得去外面跟他们汇报\N{\rENG}Which means we'd have to go outside to report back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,更重要的是\N{\rENG}More importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:00.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,神庙内不能用传送器\N{\rENG}We cannot transport from inside this chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.42,0:17:03.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,情况很不理想\N{\rENG}Far from ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:04.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿开了\N{\rENG}It's open here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.06,0:17:10.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么光学障碍在那边\N{\rENG}Some kind of light barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.13,0:17:13.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,行吧 不管这是什么 我不喜欢它\N{\rENG}Yeah, whatever it is, I don't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,害怕夜魔了吗\N{\rENG}Scared of El Cucuy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:19.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我又不是五岁小孩 而且这也不是睡觉时间\N{\rENG}I'm not five, and it's not my bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.30,0:17:24.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么 一个巨大的\N{\rENG}Hey, what's that, an oversized...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.04,0:17:27.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,袋子 我本来要说 袋子\N{\rENG}Bag. I was gonna say bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.84,0:17:29.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这是尸体\N{\rENG}but, nope, it's a body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.99,0:17:43.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 他们不是永生的\N{\rENG}Well, they're not immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.59,0:17:46.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,读数显示这些残躯已经有几百个年头了\N{\rENG}The readings indicate these remains are centuries old.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.93,0:17:48.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,死因应该是饥饿\N{\rENG}Cause of death appears to be starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:50.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们被困在这儿了\N{\rENG}They were trapped down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是一种直觉 但是我寻思\N{\rENG}Just a hunch, but it looks to me
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.73,0:17:54.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们应该是来盗墓的\N{\rENG}like they were trying to rob the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.67,0:17:57.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,这么看来 这次任务的风险更高了\N{\rENG}This discovery raises the threat level of the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:59.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须离开 向舰长汇报\N{\rENG}We must exit, report this to the captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.44,0:18:00.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,重新评估这次调查的可行性\N{\rENG}and reassess our investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.61,0:18:02.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\rENG}Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是克莉丝汀在主管这次任务吗\N{\rENG}Isn't Christine in charge of this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:06.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,其实 史波克是高级科学官\N{\rENG}Actually, Spock is the senior science officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:08.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我不用听星际舰队的 不是吗\N{\rENG}Well, I don't answer to Starfleet, now, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 这种风险忽然变大\N{\rENG}Look... this is not the first time
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:14.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,但还不构成致命威胁的情况\N{\rENG}that a landing party mission has faced
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:17.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,外勤队已经不是第一次见了\N{\rENG}escalated but not lethal danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:19.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际舰队的规章明确规定了\N{\rENG}Starfleet protocol clearly states
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.09,0:18:20.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,外勤队必须警告星舰\N{\rENG}a landing party must alert the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:22.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,告知一切明确存在的威胁\N{\rENG}to any clear and present danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.33,0:18:24.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,-但什么危险的事都还没发生呢 -史波克\N{\rENG}-But nothing dangerous has happened. -Spock,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:26.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在这里的发现实在是太重要了\N{\rENG}wh-what we can discover here is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.73,0:18:29.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,不只是对我 也不只是对罗杰\N{\rENG}Not just to me, not just to Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至不只是对于科学而言\N{\rENG}Not even just to science.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.11,0:18:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 玛克戎人\N{\rENG}N'Jal, the M'Kroons,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:35.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他们的历史\N{\rENG}this is their history.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.61,0:18:41.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像你说的 这不只和我们有关\N{\rENG}As you've stated, this is not just about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.18,0:18:45.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 在这里 我们是你的客人\N{\rENG}N'Jal, we are your guests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:47.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,你希望我们撤退还是继续调查\N{\rENG}Would you prefer if we cease or proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.80,0:18:58.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,最贴切的翻译是\N{\rENG}Closest translation:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:02.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,「我的人民一直殷切地希望」\N{\rENG}"My people have a deep desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.50,0:19:04.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,「能知道我们民族的内核」\N{\rENG}We wish to know the core of our being."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:11.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,信任是双向的 史波克\N{\rENG}Trust is a two-way street, Spock.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.42,0:19:18.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们将继续执行任务\N{\rENG}We will continue with the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:26.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我帮你\N{\rENG}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:32.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰\N{\rENG}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.02,0:19:45.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是一块忆石\N{\rENG}It's a memory stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.82,0:19:48.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,和我们在普莱托利安上找到的一样\N{\rENG}It's just like the ones we found on Praetorian.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.32,0:19:49.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀 这个\N{\rENG}Christine, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.68,0:19:53.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,这正是我们来这里要找的东西\N{\rENG}this is exactly what we came here to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.58,0:19:57.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\rENG}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.70,0:20:08.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘贝尔\N{\rENG}Gamble!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.37,0:20:10.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘贝尔 甘贝尔 你没事吧\N{\rENG}Gamble, Gamble, Gamble, Gamble, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:27.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松 放轻松 你会没事的\N{\rENG}Easy, easy. I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:47.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们刚把碎片送去佩利亚那里分析了\N{\rENG}We just sent the fragments to Pelia for analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:49.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他一捡起这个球体 它就被激活了\N{\rENG}The orb triggered when he picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:51.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,让小队其他人集合\N{\rENG}Gather the rest of the team
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后马上传送回舰\N{\rENG}and beam back aboard immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.14,0:20:55.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,收到 舰长\N{\rENG}Understood, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:03.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘贝尔怎么样了\N{\rENG}How's Gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.63,0:21:04.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,状态稳定下来了\N{\rENG}He's stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:05.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加正在\N{\rENG}M'Benga's already working on
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.03,0:21:07.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他设计一对新的眼睛\N{\rENG}bioengineering him new eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:08.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们找到了一些东西\N{\rENG}We found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.80,0:21:10.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想这是什么登记表吧\N{\rENG}I think this is some kind of register.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.91,0:21:12.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有几千个名字\N{\rENG}There are thousands of names here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.58,0:21:15.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,其中的一些也被写在了那些尸体附近的古物上\N{\rENG}Some of which are actually on the artifact you found among the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:20.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙们 在这里我们是可以学到很多东西\N{\rENG}Guys, this is great, and there's so much to learn here,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.05,0:21:21.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们该走了\N{\rENG}but it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:22.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该回舰了\N{\rENG}We got to get back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.58,0:21:25.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔和我 我们两个要留下\N{\rENG}N'Jal and I are, are gonna stay behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.30,0:21:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,像这样的发现 我等了一辈子\N{\rENG}Waited my whole life for a find like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰\N{\rENG}Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rENG}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:32.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\rENG}Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:33.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\rENG}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.66,0:21:35.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我让一个摄像头穿过走廊去看看了\N{\rENG}I sent a camera through the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:37.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么时候干的 我们已经要离开了\N{\rENG}Before or after we said to pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.96,0:21:42.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是隔壁房间吗\N{\rENG}That's the next chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:46.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\rENG}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.97,0:21:47.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说的什么意思\N{\rENG}What's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:48.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,「危险」\N{\rENG}"Danger."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.04,0:21:52.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,不{\fsp-30}是{\fsp0}「危险」\N{\rENG}Not "danger."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:54.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,是「恶魔」\N{\rENG}"Evil."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.04,0:21:54.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 发生什么了\N{\rENG}N'Jal, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.34,0:21:58.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都死定了\N{\rENG}We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.21,0:22:00.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 奈杰尔\N{\rENG}N'Jal. N'Jal!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.68,0:22:16.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,门关了\N{\rENG}The door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:26.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你好 有人在吗\N{\rENG}Hello? Who's here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.01,0:22:28.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么这么黑\N{\rENG}Why is it dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.98,0:22:30.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽量先不要坐起来\N{\rENG}Try not to sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.72,0:22:33.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,是戴着这个我才看不见吗\N{\rENG}Is this why I can't see?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.40,0:22:34.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.22,0:22:37.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的眼球被从眼眶里拽出来了\N{\rENG}Your bulbus oculi were ejected from their orbital sockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:38.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我眼睛没了?\N{\rENG}I lost my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:40.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个仪器本应该帮你再生出一对眼睛来\N{\rENG}This should be regenerating them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:43.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,但现在 它只能防止伤口进一步的恶化\N{\rENG}But right now it's just keeping them from deteriorating further.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:44.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是什么时候受伤的\N{\rENG}When was I injured?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.54,0:22:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在那颗星球上被某种手雷击伤了\N{\rENG}You were injured on the planet by a grenade of some type.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.16,0:22:51.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还在分析手雷碎片\N{\rENG}We're still analyzing the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.94,0:22:53.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,外勤队呢 他们还好吗\N{\rENG}The landing party? Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:54.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他人没有受伤\N{\rENG}The others are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:55.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们很快就会传送回来\N{\rENG}They should be back here any minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.58,0:22:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的短期记忆受损了\N{\rENG}My short-term memory was damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:22:59.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望不是永久的\N{\rENG}Hopefully, it's not permanent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:02.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是创伤后的应激反应\N{\rENG}A post-traumatic stress response.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.30,0:23:04.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,他状态怎么样\N{\rENG}Status?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.34,0:23:06.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,意识清醒 很警惕\N{\rENG}Conscious. Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.28,0:23:08.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且很害怕 但很庆幸活下来了\N{\rENG}And scared but happy to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.62,0:23:11.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,理解 情有可原\N{\rENG}Well, that's understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:16.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,休息一会吧 我马上就回来\N{\rENG}Rest. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.68,0:23:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 给我完整的报告\N{\rENG}All right, what's the full report?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:21.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要更改我最初的诊断\N{\rENG}I've shifted my initial assessment
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是简单的闪光灼伤\N{\rENG}from flash burn
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:24.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,而是某种智能体造成的\N{\rENG}to some kind of agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:26.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,生物武器吗\N{\rENG}Biological weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:27.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\rENG}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有传染性 以防你要问\N{\rENG}And before you ask, he's not contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,但有什么东西在阻止他的眼睛再生\N{\rENG}But something is preventing his eyes from regenerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:35.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你还好吗\N{\rENG}Okay, how are you holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.41,0:23:36.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还好\N{\rENG}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.78,0:23:40.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道 甘贝尔原本是来替班查普尔的\N{\rENG}You know, when Gamble came on to replace Chapel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,本来是暂时性的顶替 但她回来之后\N{\rENG}it was supposed to be temporary, but she came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.75,0:23:44.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,而他留在这里了\N{\rENG}And he stayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:47.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都看得出来我很喜欢那个孩子\N{\rENG}It's no secret I'm fond of the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.30,0:23:51.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还没准备好出外勤任务\N{\rENG}He wasn't ready for away missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.39,0:23:52.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫 你比谁都清楚\N{\rENG}Joseph, you know more than most,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.96,0:23:54.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不可能保护好所有人\N{\rENG}we can't protect everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.98,0:23:58.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,但能救治他的人非你莫属\N{\rENG}But if anyone's going to help him, it's going to be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.40,0:24:25.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么偏偏现在锁上了\N{\rENG}It's locked. Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.36,0:24:27.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个建筑肯定启动了安全协议\N{\rENG}The structure must have engaged a safety protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.94,0:24:30.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀 你和拉安带着甘布尔出去的时候\N{\rENG}Christine, it didn't trigger
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.08,0:24:31.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个机关还没有被触发\N{\rENG}when you and La'An took Gamble through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们回来时也没有\N{\rENG}Or when you came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.80,0:24:35.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你开门的时候 它提取了你的DNA样本\N{\rENG}When you unlocked the door, it took a sample of your DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.07,0:24:37.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,你被扫描了\N{\rENG}You were scanned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.34,0:24:39.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,当时我们是一起进来的\N{\rENG}And we all entered together as a group.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.37,0:24:40.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的生物特征保护了大家\N{\rENG}Your biosignature kept us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.08,0:24:44.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后 奈杰尔想单独离开\N{\rENG}So, N'Jal tried to leave without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.95,0:24:50.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 这扇门以前还肯认我 现在彻底不认了\N{\rENG}Well, if the door liked me then, it's done liking me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.22,0:24:52.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 不 肯定有别的出路\N{\rENG}No, no, there has to be another way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.22,0:24:54.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道 光靠等下去只有死路一条\N{\rENG}We know what happens if we try to wait things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.46,0:24:57.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说要继续往建筑深处走？\N{\rENG}You are suggesting we go deeper into the structure?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.68,0:24:59.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,留在这里只会饿死\N{\rENG}We stay here and we starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:02.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论如何都有风险\N{\rENG}Either way is a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.46,0:25:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我倾向于更主动的选择\N{\rENG}I prefer the one that keeps us active.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.87,0:25:06.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以吗\N{\rENG}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.47,0:25:07.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.00,0:25:09.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉安\N{\rENG}La'An.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.26,0:25:15.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝托的摄像头还在传回另一间房的画面\N{\rENG}Beto's camera's still showing the feed from the other chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:19.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来还算安全\N{\rENG}It looks safe, relatively.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.82,0:25:25.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以那个房间就在这扇门后面吗\N{\rENG}So that chamber is on the other side of this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.86,0:25:26.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rENG}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:32.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 试试看\N{\rENG}Okay, let's try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.86,0:25:34.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔\N{\rENG}Chapel?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.83,0:25:37.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,说不定这扇门还认你呢\N{\rENG}Maybe this door still likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.19,0:26:05.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.96,0:26:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\rENG}That worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:11.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,为防万一 我们应该保持之前的队形\N{\rENG}As a precaution, we should use the same formation as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.10,0:26:12.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rENG}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.50,0:26:14.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,以防我们被强光烧成灰吗\N{\rENG}Precaution against being incinerated by burning light?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.04,0:26:17.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔跟我 乌乎拉跟贝托\N{\rENG}Chapel with me. Uhura, Beto.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.34,0:26:19.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克和科尔比 你们殿后\N{\rENG}Spock and Korby, you take up the rear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\rENG}Look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰 这\N{\rENG}Roger, this...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.31,0:26:54.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不见了\N{\rENG}They're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.98,0:27:06.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 我们先想想\N{\rENG}Wait. Let's think about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.65,0:27:09.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,-再过去恐怕我们也要走散 -是的\N{\rENG}-We could get separated, too. -Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:10.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,通讯呢\N{\rENG}Huh, what about comms?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我们联系不上星舰 但是\N{\rENG}I know we can't reach the ship, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.40,0:27:14.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许\N{\rENG}Maybe,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.20,0:27:17.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许干扰是来自建筑本身的\N{\rENG}maybe the interference is coming from the building itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.36,0:27:24.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,拉安呼叫史波克 收到请回答\N{\rENG}La'An to Spock, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.15,0:27:28.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克收到\N{\rENG}Spock here, I read you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.62,0:27:31.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,科尔比博士和我在一个单独的房间里\N{\rENG}Dr. Korby and I appear to be in a room by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.31,0:27:35.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也收到了 是我和贝托\N{\rENG}We copy, too. It's Beto and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.11,0:27:36.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然还在一起\N{\rENG}Also alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.58,0:27:40.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,但也就只有我们了\N{\rENG}Together but alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.25,0:27:41.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还有通讯\N{\rENG}We have comms.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.69,0:27:43.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,勉强算是个好消息吧\N{\rENG}I'd call that a silver lining.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.50,0:27:45.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.46,0:27:46.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,都待在原地别动\N{\rENG}Stay put wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.82,0:27:48.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,没意见\N{\rENG}No arguments here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.20,0:27:49.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,同意\N{\rENG}Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.20,0:27:56.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的房间正中间有个大雕像吗\N{\rENG}Do you guys have a giant statue in the middle of your chamber?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:27:59.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的房间和刚离开的那个一模一样\N{\rENG}Our room looks just like the one we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.92,0:28:01.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,连盗墓贼的尸体都在\N{\rENG}Dead grave robbers and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.51,0:28:04.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,或许我们应该勘察一下各自的区域\N{\rENG}Perhaps we should surveil our respective areas
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.16,0:28:05.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后再汇报\N{\rENG}and report back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.32,0:28:06.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rENG}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.48,0:28:08.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们十分钟后再重新联络\N{\rENG}Let's reconvene on comms in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.32,0:28:09.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,保持警惕\N{\rENG}And stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.76,0:28:18.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,暂无定论\N{\rENG}Inconclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.20,0:28:40.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,好痒\N{\rENG}That tickles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.28,0:28:43.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,你醒了\N{\rENG}You're awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.06,0:28:46.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个根本没用 是吧\N{\rENG}This isn't doing anything, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.12,0:28:49.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 没用\N{\rENG}No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.60,0:28:52.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,我到底怎么了 约瑟夫\N{\rENG}What's happening to me, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.68,0:28:56.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫我的名字了\N{\rENG}You used my first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:59.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉 姆本加医生\N{\rENG}I'm sorry. Dr. M'Benga.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.66,0:29:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,-你说得对 -没事 挺好的\N{\rENG}-You're right, I... -No, it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.44,0:29:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你早该在我面前别那么拘谨了\N{\rENG}It's more than time you feel comfortable around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.74,0:29:06.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来死里逃生\N{\rENG}I guess a close call like that
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.22,0:29:07.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的能让人想通一些事\N{\rENG}can really put some things in perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:11.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个读数\N{\rENG}This reading...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.88,0:29:13.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\rENG}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.64,0:29:26.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 我们再试一次\N{\rENG}All right, let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.17,0:29:35.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rENG}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:36.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,是什么 读数怎么说\N{\rENG}What is it? What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.12,0:29:40.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多测试\N{\rENG}We need more tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:41.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,医生\N{\rENG}Doctor...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.48,0:29:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫 你就告诉我吧\N{\rENG}Joseph, just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.28,0:29:46.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能直说了\N{\rENG}There's no other way to put this,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.54,0:29:48.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的大脑已经死了\N{\rENG}your brain is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.88,0:29:52.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,扫描显示整个脑叶 所有的电子 神经元\N{\rENG}The scan shows entire lobes, electrons, neurons,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.20,0:29:53.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,全都停止活动了\N{\rENG}all shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.68,0:29:56.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能 那我怎么还活着\N{\rENG}No. That's impossible. How am I alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.38,0:29:57.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还醒着 还能说话\N{\rENG}I-I'm awake, we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.68,0:29:59.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我知道 正如我所说\N{\rENG}Yes, I know. Exactly like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.46,0:30:00.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要更多测试\N{\rENG}We need more tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.80,0:30:02.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还没死\N{\rENG}I'm not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.40,0:30:04.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,-嘿 深呼吸 我没说你死了 -不 但是\N{\rENG}-Hey, take a breath, I didn't say that. -No, but, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.58,0:30:07.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要给你打一针镇定剂 放松\N{\rENG}I'm giving you a sedative. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.10,0:30:08.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是\N{\rENG}But--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.44,0:30:09.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静下来\N{\rENG}Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.74,0:30:13.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会弄明白的\N{\rENG}I'll figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.94,0:30:19.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,-查普尔 -嗯?\N{\rENG}-Chapel. -Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.34,0:30:22.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么这个考古遗址里会出现地球语言\N{\rENG}Why is there an Earth language at your ancient dig site?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.74,0:30:24.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,是中文\N{\rENG}It's Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.38,0:30:28.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,「永恒之桥的守望者矗立于此」\N{\rENG}"Here stands the Beholder, sentry of eternal bridges."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.18,0:30:33.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,居然有生物信号\N{\rENG}A biosignature?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.58,0:30:38.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,这东西有生命迹象\N{\rENG}This thing has a life sign reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.38,0:30:43.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着没那么有生气啊\N{\rENG}Doesn't act very alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.58,0:30:46.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 严格来说这东西既是活的也是死的\N{\rENG}Oh, well, technically, it's both alive and not.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:48.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且 它不是真的在这里\N{\rENG}Also, it's not really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.32,0:30:52.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 反正我正在看着它 所以\N{\rENG}Hmm, well, I'm looking right at it, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.12,0:30:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,在量子水平上 组成这个守望者的粒子\N{\rENG}On a quantum level, the-the particles that make up
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.26,0:30:59.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,是不断变化的\N{\rENG}this Beholder are in constant flux.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.09,0:31:01.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,既在这里也不在这里\N{\rENG}Both here and not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.48,0:31:07.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,分子水平上的量子不稳定性\N{\rENG}Quantum instability at a molecular level.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.50,0:31:10.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,真好\N{\rENG}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.05,0:31:13.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以这是什么意思\N{\rENG}So what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.86,0:31:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全不知道呢\N{\rENG}Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.72,0:31:17.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,那很好了\N{\rENG}Brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.98,0:31:23.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,这真的是我们之前来过的同一个房间吗\N{\rENG}Is this really the same room we were just in?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.78,0:31:27.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许是 但你看\N{\rENG}Perhaps, but look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.76,0:31:33.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,鉴于奈杰尔的下场 我可不会去那里\N{\rENG}I wouldn't go that way after what happened to N'Jal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.37,0:31:38.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的觉得那只是个幻想吗\N{\rENG}Do you really think it's a fantasy?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.94,0:31:41.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你反对永生这个想法吗\N{\rENG}You balk at the idea of immortality?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.20,0:31:44.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你难道觉得世上不存在科学的手段\N{\rENG}You don't think that the science exists
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.60,0:31:46.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,来防止我们的意识消散吗\N{\rENG}to prevent our consciousness from fading?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.77,0:31:49.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不反对你的想法 科尔比博士\N{\rENG}I do not balk at your ideas, Dr. Korby.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.64,0:31:52.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是认为你疏于做适当的预防措施\N{\rENG}I merely believe you neglect to take the proper precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.11,0:31:54.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\rENG}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.12,0:31:56.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说你疏于做适当的\N{\rENG}I said you neglect to take the proper...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.70,0:31:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 看这里\N{\rENG}No, no, no, no, look here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.18,0:32:02.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,在名字上面 这个词 意思是\N{\rENG}Above the names, this-this word, it means, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.72,0:32:04.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,寄生虫 或者搭便车的人\N{\rENG}parasites or hitchhikers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.74,0:32:07.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有这个词 意思是井或者是坑\N{\rENG}And-and this word, it means well or pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.96,0:32:09.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个词 Vezda\N{\rENG}This word... Vezda.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.99,0:32:12.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,Vezda 玛克戎语中{\fsp-30}的{\fsp0}「邪恶{\fsp-30}」{\fsp0}一词吗\N{\rENG}Vezda. The M'Kroon word for evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.90,0:32:14.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,是\N{\rENG}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.50,0:32:18.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个词只在这里用过 而且\N{\rENG}Only here it's used, Vezda, it-it...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.27,0:32:20.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,是复数\N{\rENG}it isn't singular.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.25,0:32:38.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,真有意思\N{\rENG}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.52,0:32:39.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\rENG}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.26,0:32:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看到什么了\N{\rENG}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.80,0:32:54.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些东西有成千上万个\N{\rENG}Thousands of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.20,0:33:26.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的外勤队还没回来\N{\rENG}Our landing party never came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.14,0:33:27.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我弟弟本不该遇到这种事\N{\rENG}My brother didn't sign up for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.62,0:33:30.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有参与项目的玛克戎联络人\N{\rENG}All of the M'Kroon liaisons on the project have
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.70,0:33:32.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,突然进入了无线电静默状态\N{\rENG}suddenly gone radio silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.81,0:33:34.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,当地人把我们的联系切断了\N{\rENG}The locals have cut us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.18,0:33:35.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就再派出一个外勤队\N{\rENG}So send down another landing party.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.81,0:33:38.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,对啊 他们不能阻止我们把我们的人救回来\N{\rENG}Aye. They cannot keep us from getting our people back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.55,0:33:39.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 他们可以\N{\rENG}Unfortunately, they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.81,0:33:41.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们签过了特别通行协议\N{\rENG}We're here with a special access agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.88,0:33:43.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能向他们求助\N{\rENG}I can reach out,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.50,0:33:45.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果大使帮不上忙 我们就自己下去\N{\rENG}if the ambassador is no help, we will go down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.94,0:33:47.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,关于我们遇到的这个爆炸装置\N{\rENG}What do we know about the explosive device
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.95,0:33:48.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道些什么\N{\rENG}that we encountered?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.36,0:33:50.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,从技术上来说\N{\rENG}Technically it's a...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:53.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个东西是个收容单元\N{\rENG}It's a, it's a containment unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.34,0:33:56.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,就其本身而言 球体不应该发生爆炸\N{\rENG}On its own, the orb should not have exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.96,0:33:59.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是由于它离开了能量源\N{\rENG}It's possible it got separated from its power source 
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.78,0:34:00.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后变弱了\N{\rENG}and weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.93,0:34:02.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们估计 最可能是因为\N{\rENG}But best we can figure is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.57,0:34:05.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,里面的能量源强行冲了出来\N{\rENG}that the energy source inside of it forced its way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.80,0:34:07.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么个强行冲出来\N{\rENG}Forced its way out, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.84,0:34:09.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,它会不会有自己的意识\N{\rENG}Could it have been sentient?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.48,0:34:11.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们无从得知\N{\rENG}Oh, we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.62,0:34:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,佩利亚 你还有什么没告诉我们\N{\rENG}Pelia, what aren't you telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.35,0:34:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个东西\N{\rENG}This thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.12,0:34:22.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,比我见过的所有东西都要古老\N{\rENG}is older than anything I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.52,0:34:25.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你觉得里面是什么\N{\rENG}What do you think was inside of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.96,0:34:28.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不确定\N{\rENG}I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.54,0:34:34.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我完全没法科学地解释这一切\N{\rENG}And I have no scientific way of putting this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.07,0:34:36.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,但不管这东西是什么\N{\rENG}but whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.97,0:34:40.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,都让我不寒而栗\N{\rENG}it gives me the heebie-jeebies.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.91,0:34:47.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘布尔少尉\N{\rENG}Ensign Gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.32,0:34:49.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长呼叫安全部 到医务室与我会合\N{\rENG}Captain to Security. Meet me in sickbay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.36,0:35:07.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,露吉雅 多么好听的名字\N{\rENG}Rukiya, what a beautiful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.36,0:35:10.30,Note,,0,0,0,,* 露吉雅是姆'本加医生的女儿 见《新世界》S01E08
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.02,0:35:10.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,真可惜你不得不放手\N{\rENG}It's a shame you had to let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.14,0:35:19.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没跟你说过露吉雅的事\N{\rENG}I never told you about Rukiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.45,0:35:24.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊\N{\rENG}Hmm, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.79,0:35:27.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,说漏嘴了\N{\rENG}My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.85,0:35:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真以为去找你的那个女人\N{\rENG}Do you think that woman who came to you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.72,0:35:31.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,的确是你女儿吗\N{\rENG}was really your daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.96,0:35:35.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,还是说你觉得有什么东西伪装成了她的模样\N{\rENG}Or do you think it was something wearing her skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.52,0:35:40.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,夺走她的泪水 吞噬她的哭喊声的某种存在\N{\rENG}Something that drank her tears and fed off her screams?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.46,0:35:45.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我说话的是谁\N{\rENG}Who am I talking to right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.24,0:35:48.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\rENG}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.00,0:35:49.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,发生什么了\N{\rENG}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.72,0:35:52.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,外来的某种智慧生命\N{\rENG}A foreign intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.16,0:35:53.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我体内吗\N{\rENG}Inside me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.53,0:35:55.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,它怎么能说话的 它在用我来说话\N{\rENG}How was it talking? It had my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.04,0:35:56.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还不知道\N{\rENG}I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.62,0:35:59.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么它要说这些东西\N{\rENG}Why would it say those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.19,0:36:01.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,放松 深呼吸\N{\rENG}Relax. Take a breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:02.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,约瑟夫\N{\rENG}Joseph...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.36,0:36:06.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有些不舒服 像偏头痛一样\N{\rENG}I'm having a reaction, feels like a migraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:11.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你\N{\rENG}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.38,0:36:13.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,囚禁者\N{\rENG}Cali-katchna!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.02,0:36:15.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,邪恶之物\N{\rENG}Mika-tah, Vezda-pah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.67,0:36:16.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长\N{\rENG}Captain...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.44,0:36:53.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\rENG}Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.28,0:37:00.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\rENG}Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:04.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,玛丽 是我\N{\rENG}Marie, it's me...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.32,0:37:23.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,别逼我这样做\N{\rENG}I don't want to have to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.38,0:37:24.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人都给我退开\N{\rENG}everybody just leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.86,0:37:26.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静\N{\rENG}Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:28.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘布尔 是我\N{\rENG}Gamble, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.44,0:37:30.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加医生\N{\rENG}Dr. M'Benga?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:34.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我本不想这样做的\N{\rENG}I didn't mean to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.89,0:37:40.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信你\N{\rENG}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:43.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了 把相位枪放下\N{\rENG}Please, put the phaser down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.60,0:37:45.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么所有人都想伤害我\N{\rENG}Why is everybody trying to hurt me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.39,0:37:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不是想伤害你 我们是想帮你\N{\rENG}They are not, we're trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.46,0:37:50.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,放下武器\N{\rENG}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.52,0:37:51.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,给他一些空间\N{\rENG}Give him room.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.67,0:37:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我让他们带走我 你会治好我吗\N{\rENG}If I let them take me, will you fix me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.80,0:37:59.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只想重新变回我自己\N{\rENG}I just want to be me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.54,0:38:02.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会的 不用担心\N{\rENG}I've got you, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.80,0:38:11.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,医务室还是禁闭室 长官\N{\rENG}Sickbay or the brig, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,扫描显示\N{\rENG}Scans are showing
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.56,0:38:21.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,这根柱子在现实空间中时隐时现\N{\rENG}this pillar is shifting in and out of this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.38,0:38:25.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你意思是 这个诡异的地下洞窟变得更诡异了?\N{\rENG}You mean the freaky underground hell hole gets even freakier?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.90,0:38:28.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们就要像那些探险家一样死在这了\N{\rENG}We're just going to die here like those explorers we found.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.54,0:38:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\rENG}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.40,0:38:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\rENG}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.76,0:38:35.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我经历过你这种情况\N{\rENG}I've been where you are right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.54,0:38:36.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也知道你现在只能满脑子想着\N{\rENG}and I know that all you can focus on
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.82,0:38:38.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一切有多么糟糕\N{\rENG}is how bad this all feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.35,0:38:40.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我满脑子都是我们单独被困在这里 还有什么东西\N{\rENG}All I can think about is being trapped down here alone with...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.58,0:38:42.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们并不孤单\N{\rENG}We're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.78,0:38:45.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会找到离开这里的方法\N{\rENG}We are going to find our way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.89,0:38:47.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一起\N{\rENG}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.95,0:38:50.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要深呼吸就好\N{\rENG}Just breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.74,0:39:03.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\rENG}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.94,0:39:12.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\rENG}I'm seeing the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.35,0:39:17.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,看\N{\rENG}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.02,0:39:19.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉呼叫外勤队\N{\rENG}Uhura to landing party,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.44,0:39:20.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我发现了什么\N{\rENG}I think I've got something.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.74,0:39:22.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们也有一些有趣的发现\N{\rENG}We have some interesting finds, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.62,0:39:24.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,确实 这里有很多可以讨论的东西\N{\rENG}Indeed, there is much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.63,0:39:28.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,这个雕像有不稳定的相位差异\N{\rENG}The statue in here is giving off unstable phase variances.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.44,0:39:30.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且它还有生命信号\N{\rENG}And it has a life sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.40,0:39:33.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,科尔比和我发现了一种智慧生命的存在\N{\rENG}Korby and I discovered the presence of sentient life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.74,0:39:37.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,有趣 我不记得有这个伤口\N{\rENG}Curious, I do not recall this injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.81,0:39:41.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了 这整件事都很奇幻\N{\rENG}Look, all of that is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.41,0:39:44.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这整个地方都是 但是重点是\N{\rENG}This whole place is, but the thing is
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.04,0:39:47.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们其实在同一个房间\N{\rENG}we are all still together.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.41,0:39:49.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能呢\N{\rENG}How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.85,0:39:52.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,直觉型软件系统\N{\rENG}The intuitive software,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.22,0:39:54.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,它检测到了我们的生物信号而且把我们\N{\rENG}it's-it's picking up our biosignatures and placing us
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.09,0:39:55.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有人放到了一个房间里\N{\rENG}all in the same room.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.30,0:39:56.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是一个多层维度的空间\N{\rENG}This is layered dimensional space.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.56,0:39:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不是在不同的房间里\N{\rENG}We're not in different rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.00,0:40:01.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,而是在不同的现实位面中\N{\rENG}This is different planes of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.06,0:40:02.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们从来都没有离开过第一个房间\N{\rENG}We never left the first chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.48,0:40:04.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果亚原子不稳定性就是\N{\rENG}If subatomic instability was being
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.52,0:40:06.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们达成永生的手段 那么\N{\rENG}utilized as a means to immortality, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.33,0:40:08.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么这个地方可能是个实验室\N{\rENG}Then maybe this place is a lab
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.47,0:40:10.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者是什么不老泉\N{\rENG}or a-a fountain of youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.50,0:40:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,这事恐怕不是这么简单\N{\rENG}I fear it is not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.00,0:40:14.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,史波克发现这些球里面困有许多生物\N{\rENG}Spock found life-forms trapped inside orbs,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.41,0:40:17.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,和伤害了甘布尔的那个东西一样\N{\rENG}just like the one that injured Gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.58,0:40:19.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,石板上称呼它们为寄生虫 搭便车的人\N{\rENG}The tablet called them parasites. Hitchhikers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.32,0:40:22.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不被欢迎的客人\N{\rENG}Unwelcome guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.02,0:40:23.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,有可能是因为 通过在不同维度中相移\N{\rENG}It is possible phase-shifting through dimensions
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.48,0:40:25.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,来达到永生有副作用\N{\rENG}to achieve immortality had a side effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.66,0:40:27.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者带来了什么东西\N{\rENG}Of bringing something through.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.80,0:40:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,到底是什么东西\N{\rENG}What kind of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.52,0:40:33.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,一些从其他地方过来的东西\N{\rENG}Somethings... from somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.32,0:40:35.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果这个地方不是什么宫殿或者实验室呢\N{\rENG}What if this place isn't a palace or a lab?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.53,0:40:38.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,它会不会是个监狱\N{\rENG}What if it's a prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.58,0:40:55.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 但是我们必须在这里看着你\N{\rENG}I'm sorry, but we'll have to look after you from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.66,0:40:56.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系的\N{\rENG}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:40:58.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能理解\N{\rENG}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.59,0:41:02.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我之后会怎么样\N{\rENG}What's gonna happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.36,0:41:08.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要是知道就好了\N{\rENG}I wish I could say.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.94,0:41:19.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,这句铭文写的是\N{\rENG}This inscription reads
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.56,0:41:21.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,「触手可及 但也遥不可及」\N{\rENG}"Here and not here."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.61,0:41:26.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,在普莱托利安上\N{\rENG}On Praetorian,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.72,0:41:29.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些文物会被放置在这样的底座上\N{\rENG}artifacts were sometimes set into pedestals like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.69,0:41:30.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,那些零部件\N{\rENG}Component parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.90,0:41:32.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要组装起来 也许就会是\N{\rENG}Together they might be the key
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.08,0:41:34.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,把维度偏移合并起来的关键\N{\rENG}to unifying the dimensional shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.22,0:41:35.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,浮雕在这里\N{\rENG}The relief there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.59,0:41:40.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,纹章戒指呢\N{\rENG}The signet ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.12,0:41:41.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,还在我这儿\N{\rENG}I still have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.58,0:41:43.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 但是该怎么样才能\N{\rENG}Okay, but how do we get those
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.26,0:41:44.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,让困在不同的位面里的我们\N{\rENG}two things to work together
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.94,0:41:46.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,把这两件东西组合起来\N{\rENG}whilst stuck on different dimensional planes?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.07,0:41:50.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,把浮雕放在写着圣龛的地方\N{\rENG}Put the tablet where it says tabernacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.91,0:41:54.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rENG}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.42,0:42:00.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,乌乎拉 戒指\N{\rENG}Uhura, the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.94,0:42:05.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 然后呢\N{\rENG}Okay. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.48,0:42:08.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是这一切的关键 对吧\N{\rENG}I'm the key to all of this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:29.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀\N{\rENG}Christine.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.15,0:42:40.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,越来越奇怪了\N{\rENG}Curiouser and curiouser.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.66,0:42:48.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的 所以现在我们重聚在一起了 但是\N{\rENG}Okay, so we're all back together, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.16,0:42:51.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们怎么到门口去\N{\rENG}...how do we get to the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.51,0:43:00.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你感觉还好吗\N{\rENG}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.91,0:43:04.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是为了以防我又失控吗\N{\rENG}In case I go off the rails again?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.65,0:43:05.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\rENG}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.91,0:43:08.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加觉得 在确保没有危险前\N{\rENG}M'Benga didn't want to release you to the quarters
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.02,0:43:10.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,还不能放你回舱室 不过\N{\rENG}without knowing it was safe, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.98,0:43:13.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我不需要用这玩意\N{\rENG}I knew I wouldn't need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.69,0:43:16.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,克里斯 我不知道当时发生了什么\N{\rENG}Chris, I don't know what happened in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.92,0:43:18.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我体内的什么东西突然就失控了\N{\rENG}Something inside of me just snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.42,0:43:20.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,甘布尔怎么样了\N{\rENG}How's Gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.76,0:43:22.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,被监禁着\N{\rENG}In custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.54,0:43:24.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,他也不太正常\N{\rENG}He's not quite himself, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.16,0:43:26.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得我看到了他 但是\N{\rENG}I remember seeing him, but it...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.30,0:43:30.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是他\N{\rENG}It wasn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.40,0:43:33.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是另一个存在\N{\rENG}He was something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.21,0:43:37.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我感觉\N{\rENG}And I felt...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.91,0:43:40.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不像自己了\N{\rENG}...like something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.32,0:43:44.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\rENG}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.89,0:43:46.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我描述不出来\N{\rENG}I can't describe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.32,0:43:51.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是遏制不住想杀死\N{\rENG}I just had this overwhelming desire to kill...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.56,0:43:55.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,不对 想抹杀他的冲动\N{\rENG}...no, to exterminate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.20,0:44:00.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少你现在回来了\N{\rENG}Well, you're back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.23,0:44:03.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,其他人对他有过这种反应吗\N{\rENG}Has anyone else reacted to him this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.20,0:44:05.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有 \N{\rENG}No. 
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.72,0:44:09.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得考虑这是你体内的戈恩基因的表现\N{\rENG}We have to consider that it's an expression of the Gorn DNA in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.38,0:44:12.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不知晓那种疗法还有什么副作用\N{\rENG}We don't know all the downsides.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.05,0:44:15.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种感受\N{\rENG}This feeling I had,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.25,0:44:16.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我解释不清楚\N{\rENG}I can't explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.92,0:44:19.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是它感觉很 古老\N{\rENG}but it felt... old.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.36,0:44:24.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,好\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.88,0:44:28.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,不论如何 我们会把它弄清楚的\N{\rENG}Whatever it is, we'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.68,0:44:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,外勤队怎么样了\N{\rENG}The landing party?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.92,0:44:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,仍然失联中\N{\rENG}Still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.76,0:44:37.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,舰长 玛克戎大使正在等待跟你通话\N{\rENG}Captain, I've got the M'Kroon Ambassador on standby for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.24,0:44:38.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,把他接过来\N{\rENG}Patch it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.38,0:44:40.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.00,0:44:44.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以 我们得想办法到门口去\N{\rENG}So, we got to find a way to get to the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.95,0:44:55.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\rENG}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.60,0:44:58.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这个被我们重组了的维度空间里\N{\rENG}In this reconstituted dimensional space,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.78,0:45:01.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,倒置的因果律与常规法则共存\N{\rENG}inverted causality coexists.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.21,0:45:03.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 你最好还是解释清楚点\N{\rENG}Uh, yeah, you're gonna have to walk me through that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.73,0:45:05.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,因果律倒置是指在某维度中\N{\rENG}Inverted causality is a dimension
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.40,0:45:07.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果出现在起因之前的现象\N{\rENG}where effects can happen before cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.26,0:45:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,呃 这是个悖论\N{\rENG}It's, uh... It's paradoxical.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.28,0:45:12.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 这是个理论假设\N{\rENG}Yes, and theoretical,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.24,0:45:14.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,但在科学上也是成立的\N{\rENG}but also scientifically possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.14,0:45:15.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,科尔比博士和我被单独分开的时候\N{\rENG}When Dr. Korby and I were separated,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.44,0:45:16.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有一座桥\N{\rENG}there was a bridge here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.81,0:45:18.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,而门旁的那个面板亮的是白光\N{\rENG}And that panel by the door was glowing white.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.60,0:45:20.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在它亮的是红光\N{\rENG}Well, it's red now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.49,0:45:22.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 所以我们肯定是把它打开了\N{\rENG}Yes. So we must have turned it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.42,0:45:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,结果出现在起因之前\N{\rENG}Effect before cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.79,0:45:29.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以你是说 不不\N{\rENG}So you're saying... No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.86,0:45:33.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.96,0:45:36.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么 什么不\N{\rENG}What? "No, no" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.60,0:45:37.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\rENG}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.96,0:45:39.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须走过那片虚空\N{\rENG}We must walk across this empty space
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.56,0:45:41.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,并开启那座桥\N{\rENG}and turn on the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.95,0:45:54.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,警卫 警卫\N{\rENG}Guard. Guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.18,0:45:56.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的母亲 她正处于痛苦之中\N{\rENG}Your mother. She's in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.06,0:45:57.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么东西正在伤害她\N{\rENG}Something's hurting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.02,0:45:59.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rENG}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.19,0:46:03.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的名字 叫雅拉\N{\rENG}Her name... it's Jara.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.40,0:46:07.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,她想告诉你是什么在伤害她\N{\rENG}She wants to tell you what's hurting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.14,0:46:09.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁告诉你的\N{\rENG}Who told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.53,0:46:16.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你伤害了我 你让我独自死去\N{\rENG}You did. You let me die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.24,0:46:34.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,不行 我才不要这么做 没门\N{\rENG}Nope, I-I'm not doing that. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.56,0:46:36.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的另一个选项是留在这里挨饿\N{\rENG}Our other option is to remain here and starve.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.36,0:46:39.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,相当有意思的战术讨论\N{\rENG}A sound tactical argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.66,0:46:42.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 你打头阵 我跟着你\N{\rENG}So... you lead, I'll follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.85,0:46:44.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,别踩到我的脚就行\N{\rENG}Just don't step on my toes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.01,0:46:46.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也愿意冒这个险\N{\rENG}I am also willing to take this risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.13,0:46:49.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,然而 我确信我们其实必须\N{\rENG}However, I believe that we must, in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.94,0:46:51.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起协力完成这件事\N{\rENG}commit to doing this all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.84,0:46:53.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有查普尔护士能开门\N{\rENG}And Nurse Chapel is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.34,0:46:57.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这么做 克莉丝汀\N{\rENG}Don't do it, Christine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.02,0:47:00.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,理论成立不代表你真的就可以浮空\N{\rENG}Theoretical doesn't mean you can just go and walk on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.05,0:47:01.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,查普尔护士\N{\rENG}Nurse Chapel,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.44,0:47:03.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,涉及许多方面的事情 你也许不如以往那般信任我\N{\rENG}I may no longer have your confidence on many things,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.68,0:47:06.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这次我们在谈的是科学\N{\rENG}but this is a matter of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.25,0:47:09.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,况且这关系到我们的生死存亡\N{\rENG}And what hangs in the balance is our survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.70,0:47:14.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们当前最需要的就是双向的信任\N{\rENG}We are on a two-way street.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.80,0:47:18.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在 我请求你 只要相信我就行\N{\rENG}And now I'm asking you to simply trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.41,0:47:21.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰 我们该离开了\N{\rENG}Roger, it's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.30,0:47:24.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,不\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.44,0:47:26.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,克莉丝汀 理智点啊\N{\rENG}Christine, listen to reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.77,0:47:29.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,是 走过去是有风险\N{\rENG}Yes, it is a risk walking out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.44,0:47:31.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是我们相识的这段不长的时间里\N{\rENG}but in the short time that I've known you,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.60,0:47:33.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你来都没有害怕过冒险\N{\rENG}you've never been afraid of taking a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.85,0:47:35.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,还记得几个月前你对我说过的话吗\N{\rENG}Remember what you said to me, all those months ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.56,0:47:38.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,「人生百态 皆无定数」\N{\rENG}"Nothing in life is guaranteed."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.44,0:47:41.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,那就是人生的意义\N{\rENG}That's what makes life worth living.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.09,0:47:45.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:48.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗杰 别碰那个古物\N{\rENG}Roger, leave the relic where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.21,0:47:51.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们能在一起全靠它了\N{\rENG}It's the only thing keeping us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.78,0:48:06.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.95,0:48:09.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看见它在这里了对吧\N{\rENG}So this is where you saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.38,0:48:11.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\rENG}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.02,0:48:16.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,明白\N{\rENG}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.73,0:48:27.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\rENG}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.30,0:48:29.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\rENG}let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.51,0:48:38.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们离开这儿\N{\rENG}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.73,0:49:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我们还活着\N{\rENG}Hey. We're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.93,0:49:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就够了\N{\rENG}Take the win.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.71,0:49:11.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,输入高级军官指令代码\N{\rENG}Senior officer command codes, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.34,0:49:12.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,不然我就杀了你\N{\rENG}or I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.65,0:49:14.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么 你在说什么\N{\rENG}What? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.91,0:49:17.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能看到这小子的思想和记忆\N{\rENG}I have the boy's thoughts, his memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.62,0:49:20.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能从轮机室超控这整艘船\N{\rENG}You can take control of this vessel from Engineering.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.65,0:49:23.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,镧族人小孩\N{\rENG}Lanthanite child.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.16,0:49:24.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么\N{\rENG}Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.36,0:49:26.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,要不换他也行\N{\rENG}Perhaps I take him instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.64,0:49:29.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者换他\N{\rENG}Or him?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.70,0:49:31.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,敢伤害他们 下一个死的就是你\N{\rENG}Hurt them and you die next.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.24,0:49:40.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,不舍得直接对你最喜欢的少尉动手 是吧\N{\rENG}you couldn't kill your favorite ensign now, could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.73,0:49:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,救救我 求你了\N{\rENG}Help, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.34,0:49:45.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加医生 是我 真的是我\N{\rENG}Dr. M'Benga, it's me, it's really me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.08,0:49:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要伤害我\N{\rENG}Don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.60,0:49:49.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,抵抗它 你能做到的\N{\rENG}Fight it. You can fight it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.44,0:49:51.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 约瑟夫 我觉得甘布尔已经不在了\N{\rENG}No, Joseph, I don't think he's really in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.42,0:49:55.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,他还在\N{\rENG}He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.79,0:50:01.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,放了那孩子 求你了\N{\rENG}Let the boy go. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.20,0:50:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,占据我的身体吧\N{\rENG}Take me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.38,0:50:09.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,别\N不
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.12,0:50:27.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你把它传送到哪了\N{\rENG}W-Where did you send it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.22,0:50:28.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,哪都没传去\N{\rENG}Nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.67,0:50:44.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,多亏佩利亚和斯考特中尉的随机应变\N{\rENG}Thanks to Pelia and Lieutenant Scott's quick thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.34,0:50:47.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该不会再见到邪灵了\N{\rENG}we should not be seeing the Vezda again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.64,0:50:48.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你确定这能困住它吗\N{\rENG}Are you sure it'll hold?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.96,0:50:50.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,在得到有关这个生命体更多信息之前\N{\rENG}Until we learn more about this entity,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.96,0:50:52.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然送不回那个多维监狱\N{\rENG}the transport buffer is the best proxy we have
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.81,0:50:54.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,传送缓存器是我们最好的替代方案了\N{\rENG}for a layered dimensional prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.89,0:50:56.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,剩下的那些怎么办\N{\rENG}What about the rest of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.17,0:50:58.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,星际舰队和玛克戎人正在合作\N{\rENG}Starfleet and the M'Kroon are already working together
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.12,0:51:00.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,在遗址周围建立安全防线\N{\rENG}to establish a security perimeter around the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.52,0:51:02.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,看来他们开始意识到\N{\rENG}Apparently, they're starting to see
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.01,0:51:03.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,加入联邦的好处了\N{\rENG}the benefits of the Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.23,0:51:07.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,要知道 如果甘布尔少尉\N{\rENG}You know, if Ensign Gamble, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.99,0:51:09.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者说附身他的生命体\N{\rENG}rather, the entity inside of him,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.88,0:51:11.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,当初控制了舰载相位炮系统\N{\rENG}had taken hold of the ship's phaser banks...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.26,0:51:12.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,他差点就能释放所有的邪灵了\N{\rENG}He could have set them all free.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.20,0:51:18.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们能想象这样一支宇宙生物大军在银河系肆虐吗\N{\rENG}An army of cosmic beings like that set loose on the galaxy?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.91,0:51:24.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 医生 我理解你很喜欢那孩子\N{\rENG}I'm sorry, Doctor, I know you were fond of the boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.54,0:51:26.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他已经不在了\N{\rENG}but he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.52,0:51:28.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,它们是邪恶的吗 舰长\N{\rENG}Were they evil, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.72,0:51:32.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看过甘布尔的行动记录\N{\rENG}I saw the recordings of what Gamble did,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.39,0:51:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,和他说过的话\N{\rENG}and the things he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.74,0:51:35.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,世上没有绝对的善恶 孩子\N{\rENG}Good and evil are relative terms, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.80,0:51:41.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,胡说 宇宙中存在绝对邪恶\N{\rENG}Nonsense. There is evil in this universe,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.76,0:51:43.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,正如存在绝对的善良\N{\rENG}as sure as there is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.94,0:51:50.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像世上存在物质 存在光明一样\N{\rENG}A-As sure as there is matter, as sure as there is light.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.97,0:51:53.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能感受到\N{\rENG}I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.14,0:51:57.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,那个存在非常古老\N{\rENG}that being was ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.48,0:51:59.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,充满恶意\N{\rENG}Malevolent.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.93,0:52:04.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,那种要将世界全部扭曲 腐化\N{\rENG}The desire to malign, to pervert...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.72,0:52:06.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,吞噬的欲望\N{\rENG}and consume,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.80,0:52:09.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,凝聚成了实体\N{\rENG}given corporeal form.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.82,0:52:13.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果那些东西\N{\rENG}If any of those things...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.73,0:52:17.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,但凡有一个逃出了那地方\N{\rENG}ever escape that well down there...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.23,0:52:20.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,只能愿上帝保佑了\N{\rENG}...God help us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.01,0:52:28.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要给它拍张照吗\N{\rENG}You want one for the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.91,0:52:31.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\rENG}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.94,0:52:33.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\rENG}No, I'm good. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.85,0:52:36.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你便\N{\rENG}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.90,0:52:47.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,姆'本加医生\N{\rENG}Dr. M'Benga?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.18,0:52:49.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,联系地球的子空间通讯频道已接通\N{\rENG}I have the subspace relay to Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.16,0:52:51.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢 把通话交给我吧\N{\rENG}Thank you. I've got it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.03,0:52:59.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,您好 我是进取号的约瑟夫·姆'本加医生\N{\rENG}Hello, I'm Dr. Joseph M'Benga of the USS Enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.21,0:53:01.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我请求与您通话\N{\rENG}I've asked to be the one to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.66,0:53:04.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,是关于您儿子\N{\rENG}It's about your son,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.91,0:53:06.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,戴纳·甘布尔的事\N{\rENG}Dana Gamble.
